<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In the mind of Jesus</l><l>There is thought for you,</l><l>Warm as summer sunshine,</l><l>Sweet as morning dew;</l><l>Why should you be fearful,</l><l>Why take anxious thought,</l><l>Since the mind of Jesus</l><l>Cares for those He bought?</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>In the field of Jesus</l><l>There is work for you;</l><l>Such as even angels</l><l>Might rejoice to do;</l><l>Why stand idly sighing</l><l>For some life-work grand,</l><l>While the field of Jesus</l><l>Seeks your reaping hand?</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>In the Church of Jesus</l><l>There’s a place for you;</l><l>Glorious, bright, and joyous,</l><l>Right and peaceful too;</l><l>Why then, like a wand’rer,</l><l>Roam with weary pace,</l><l>If the Church of Jesus</l><l>Holds for you a place?</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
